<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Force (230)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>force &lt;someone&gt; &lt;command&gt;
force all &lt;command&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>force guard north
force Gnort stand
</pre>
<p>Makes someone carry out a command, as if they had typed it.
</p><p><b>Monsters</b> (level 230): the one named here, or else in this zone, or 
else anywhere in the world.
</p><p><b>Players</b> (level 245): anywhere in the game. Use it only to help a 
player in a tight spot; they are told that you forced them, and what to.
</p><p><b>force all</b> (level 245) forces every player in the game of a lower 
level than yours; also known as power abuse.
</p><p>You can't force anyone of a higher level than yours. It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Switch</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp At</a>
</pre>




</div>